      "description": "Current Students Staff Alumni Quicklinks University email MyAdelaide MyUni Library Staff Directory Study at Adelaide We are the highest ranked university in South Australia and top 100 in the world. Find your degree Contact us Undergraduate Undergraduate degrees How to Apply Entry pathways Why study at Adelaide? Careers & Employability Year 12 Tuition First Nations Study with us Postgraduate Postgraduate Coursework Postgraduate research Online study Executive education & short courses Explore courses International Find your degree Life in Adelaide Admissions Apply Scholarships English Language Centre Research & Innovation Our research & innovation Division & leadership Our performance Find a researcher Research Institutes Research Centres Research Facilities & Precincts Research impact Research impact stories Discovery podcast series Connect Partner with us ThincLab Graduate Research Training Opportunities Work with us Innovation & Commercialisation Services Research support Researcher Portal Adelaide Graduate Research School Research Technology Support Research institutes Environment Machine Learning Sustainability, Energy and Resources Photonics & Advanced Sensing Robinson Research SAiGENCI Waite Research Research events Research Tuesdays Engage Give Now Alumni Reconnect Reunions Alumni networks Alumni news & events Awards & recognition Become a volunteer Give to Adelaide Give now Give to an appeal Leave a gift in your will More ways to give Impact of giving More information Industry & government Partnerships Sponsorships Global Engagement ThincLab Community Volunteer program Wirltu Yarlu Lumen About the Uni Discover Adelaide University Learn more about South Australia's new university for the future. Find out more University profile History Mission & focus The City of Adelaide Awards & achievements Kaurna acknowledgement First Nations Strategic Plan Facts & figures World rankings Global reputation Leadership & structure Faculties & divisions